Flowcraft contains adapted work from the following MIT-licensed projects:

- Actions-bbr-v3, copyright its contributors
  https://github.com/byJoey/Actions-bbr-v3
  Kernel patches, kernel configuration policy, and build helpers are adapted
  from commit c13d9ef51b7be6b167103952ff08bfff2b844054.

- tcp-dashboard, copyright its contributors
  https://github.com/666shen/tcp-dashboard
  IPv4 address-selection and RPS/RFS concepts are adapted from commit
  39e0d7fd1e179805cd3fe066f27b1ec899401845. The upstream script itself is not
  embedded because that snapshot does not pass Bash syntax validation.

- NetShape Manager, copyright its contributors
  https://github.com/bear4f/netshape-manager
  Role profiles, BDP buffer sizing, qdisc fallback, diagnostics, and rollback
  concepts are adapted from commit 0489e8d4b70e350dbda27bd3553c3a963fd2425f.

- tcpfit, copyright its contributors
  https://github.com/Kylin010/tcpfit
  Memory-aware TCP buffer headroom, public peer discovery, port rotation,
  policer-loss classification, coarse/fine knee measurement, and rate-margin
  policy are adapted from commit 67c0bdfb35dd98e86982600298237b6ecc08ebe4.

